%% Six packages; eight dependency signatures. Labeled package rectangles and flowchart arrow glyphs stand in for native UML folders/open dependencies.
%% Every dashed open arrow is source-code package dependency, not REST/WS runtime traffic. No package-to-package realization is implied.
%% Presentation relies on versioned public API contracts; this does not require shared compiled client/backend code.
%% Domain has no dependency on UI, frameworks, providers, storage or contracts. Application owns its port interfaces.
%% Infrastructure -> Domain is observed in current source (3 files); other observed deviations are excluded from this package view.
%% The three product surfaces and Android React Native / TypeScript and FastAPI / Python facts are confirmed.
%% Teacher/Admin frameworks remain TBD.
%% Child Android, Teacher Desktop and Super Admin are confirmed surfaces. Teacher/Admin have no new implementation yet (B15).
%% Child Android source contains apps/mobile (RN 0.87 skeleton) and apps/ui-mobile (Expo 52 / RN 0.76.9 demo); runtime/version choice remains open (OD15).
%% B8 contexts, realtime entry points, telemetry and adapter implementations remain proposed.
%% Contract boundary shapes are distinct from domain entities; provider/model responses must be mapped and validated.
%% Runtime protocols, separate worker process, telemetry and provider/candidate choices remain in the System Architecture tab.
%% Names map to System Architecture: Inbound Adapters = backend API entry; Infrastructure Adapters = Backend adapters; Application-owned ports = Application ports.

