    APPLICATION["<b>«package» Application</b><br/><br/>Use cases · authorization / consent<br/>Scope / version checks<br/><br/><b>Application-owned ports</b><br/>Repository · Artifact · Job<br/>Identity · Model · Realtime<br/>Code: backend/src/sketch2life/application<br/>Ports: application/ports"]

